1627
01:07:54.612 --> 01:07:55.905
{\an8}Ayo.

1628
01:07:56.489 --> 01:07:58.866
{\an8}<i>...Pembunuh Cho Yo-sep?</i>

1629
01:08:10.836 --> 01:08:11.712
{\an8}<i>Tidak, bukan!</i>

1630
01:08:11.796 --> 01:08:14.507
{\an8}Sudah kubilang!

1631
01:08:14.590 --> 01:08:16.550
{\an8}Dasar idiot!

1632
01:08:17.384 --> 01:08:19.512
{\an8}<i>-Tidak, bukan!</i>
- Sudah kubilang!

1633
01:08:19.595 --> 01:08:20.930
{\an8}PERHATIAN GAGAL PERTAMA
DI TKP KEJAHATAN NOL

1634
01:08:21.013 --> 01:08:22.890
{\an8}Dasar idiot!

1635
01:08:23.599 --> 01:08:26.560
Aku sudah bilang padamu. Saya Detektif Kim,
