1651
01:09:13.691 --> 01:09:16.777
{\an8}Aku merasa sangat dikhianati.

1652
01:09:16.861 --> 01:09:18.612
{\an8}Kamu pasti bercanda.

1653
01:09:19.155 --> 01:09:22.575
{\an8}<i>Dengan demikian, pembunuh sebenarnya,
